It does work, slightly modified:

m$v744_beatingJustified <- apply(m[,c(35:39)], 1, function(x) {
  if(sum(is.na <http://is.na>(x)) == length(x)) return(NA)
  if(any(x, na.rm=T) == 1) return(1)
  0
})

thanks!

