Hi Wenjie,

Do you have anonymous functions in your code like:

sapply(1:10, function(x) message("this is an anonymous function!"))

if so, try:

my_named_func <- function(x) message("this is an anonymous function!")
sapply(1:10, my_named_func)

This should help.

HTH,
V

