Subject: Re: [D-RUG]: question regarding agricolae package for split-plot design with significant main-plot x sub-plot interaction
Message-ID: <PnbK2ZDi9tM.BvadyTBjCgAJ@davis-rug.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <PnbK2ZDi9tM.pruxVmBcCgAJ@davis-rug.groups.google.com>
References: <PnbK2ZDi9tM.jiXxJPIcCgAJ@davis-rug.groups.google.com> <PnbK2ZDi9tM.pruxVmBcCgAJ@davis-rug.groups.google.com>
